  ('Study — plan heading', 'sec_plan', '🗓 THIS WEEK', 8),
  ('Study — plan line ({n} {date})', 'plan_line', '{n} topics a week covers the rest by {date}. Start with these:', 9),
  ('Study — plan all confident', 'plan_done', 'Every topic marked 🟢 Confident. Keep practising the mixed questions.', 10),
  ('Study — practice heading', 'sec_practice', '✏️ PRACTICE', 11),
